tate be for that  one  [Music]  that's what I was looking for fantastic  man  Hey look I really love what you're doing  Malcolm I really enjoy watching you play  football and then and then realizing  that there's a greater aspect of life  and you know and I've really liked how  you're going about your business quite  frankly I appreciate that you got it and  you know I asked this of Chris long this  will be the last question for you  what do you say to the stick to sports  crowd Malcolm those who tune into the  National Football League to be  entertained not to have this  conversation placed next to their  escapism what do you say to that well  the biggest thing is I try to get people  to empathize with me I don't like  preaching to people but the NFL is made  up of 70% black athletes each of these  teams have stadiums or playing cities  that are in urban communities and so to  ignore some of the problems in those  communities I think would be wrong and  so even you know here in Philadelphia  you know as we look at we're approaching  Labor Day and we celebrate you know  people's rights to get jobs and provide  and then you can look into some  african-american communities communities  that are represent communities that I've  come from and I've seen how you know  people who made mistakes over the years  or our criminal justice system and stop  people from getting jobs and so there's  opportunities for us to highlight ways  to change that and we have that platform  we have that ability and so for me to  get on this stage and stay silent I  think would be just as wrong as somebody  who you know was trying to stop that  changes altogether okay well good luck  against Washington in Week one Malcolm  good luck against Indiana on Thursday  night for your team and like I told you  moments ago I really like what you're  doing and like Ohio State last November  I'm there for you the whole nine yards  okay take care that's uh Malcolm Jenkins  Malcolm Jenkins on Twitter the Rich  Eisen show weekdays at noon eastern on  radio stations across the country and  audience if you like that please  download our app there's lots of fun  things there other than just more of the  videos you just saw you can call us from  the app you can email us from the app  just download it trust me you'll enjoy

